  <category name="Chart Cue">
    <reapack name="Chart Cue.lua" type="script" desc="Chart Cue: Open PDF Viewer">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Chart Cue - PDF Viewer for REAPER. Shows PDF charts and scrolls them with markers, cue lists, MIDI CC, mouse wheel or dragging; 1 or 2 PDFs per song. Windows only. Requires: the free ReaImGui extension. Install it first: Extensions > ReaPack > Browse packages > "ReaImGui" > Install, then restart REAPER.\par}
}
]]></description>
      </metadata>
