  <category name="MIDI Pilot">
    <reapack name="MIDI Pilot.lua" type="script" desc="MIDI Pilot: MIDI editor for Quad Cortex">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 MIDI Pilot - write the MIDI for a Neural DSP Quad Cortex or Quad Cortex mini in REAPER: presets at the song starts, scenes by name, knob values in real units, nudges and ramps. The MIDI plays without the script. Requires: the free ReaImGui extension (ReaPack).\par}
}
]]></description>
      </metadata>
      <version name="0.1" author="Nick Gkogkomitros" time="2026-11-06T06:19:54Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[First version (step 1): the window, the devices (Quad Cortex or mini, MIDI output and channel) and their tracks.]]></changelog>
        <source main="main">https://github.com/thunderfork/reaper-scripts/raw/bf66297b65fce617389c2a18f2d4bee4b3587673/MIDI%20Pilot/MIDI%20Pilot.lua</source>
      </version>
      <version name="0.1.1" author="Nick Gkogkomitros" time="2026-11-07T02:11:43Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[The full first version (0.1 on ReaPack was an early build): presets and scenes by name at the song starts, knob values in real units with ramps and
swells, nudge and latency, and the state at the song starts (Fill songs, Live chase, Send state).]]></changelog>
        <source main="main">https://github.com/thunderfork/reaper-scripts/raw/61b85c627cb55a7d25c169d64fac158024ad855a/MIDI%20Pilot/MIDI%20Pilot.lua</source>
      </version>
    </reapack>
