  <category name="Segue">
    <reapack name="Segue.lua" type="script" desc="Segue: Setlist player">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Segue - a setlist for REAPER. Plays the songs (regions) of your project in the order of your show: at the end of each song REAPER stops or goes on with the next song; pauses between songs. The timeline does not change. Requires: the free ReaImGui extension (ReaPack).\par}
}
]]></description>
      </metadata>
